'''FUT Esports''' (formerly known as '''Futbolist''') is a [[:Category:Turkey|Turkish]] esports organization.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
|This=2

|content1=
*May 26th - '''FUT Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with a lineup consisting of [[devoduvek]], [[drac]], [[JACKZ]], [[misutaaa]], [[Nivera]], and [[falco]] as coach. <ref name="FUT">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/1927047087180435792|title=FUT CS2 has joined the server|date=2025-05-26|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 1st - '''FUT Esports''' bench their roster except for [[misutaaa]] and acquire the roster of [[Natus Vincere Junior]] consisting of [[dem0n]], [[Krabeni]], [[cmtry]], [[dziugss]], and [[coolio]] as coach. <ref name="FUT NAVI JR">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/1951312039546151162|title=Future is FUT|date=2025-08-01|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 4th - '''FUT Esports''' release [[devoduvek]], [[drac]], [[JACKZ]], [[Nivera]], and [[falco]]. <ref name="-FR FUT">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/1952375941847728567|title=We have come to the end of a story|date=2025-08-04|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 22nd - '''FUT Esports''' bench [[misutaaa]] and acquire [[lauNX]] from [[Nexus Gaming]] as his replacement. <ref name="bench misutaaa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/1958907042049176002|title=We thank @misutaaaCSGO for his efforts and contributions|date=2025-08-22|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+launx">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/1958907037863022891|title=Fresh energy, new fire|date=2025-08-22|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>
*September 18th - [[misutaaa]] is acquired by an undisclosed organization, later revealed to be [[GenOne]]. <ref name="-misutaaa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/1968676332637725031|title=Today, we say farewell to our player @misutaaaCSGO and wish him the best of luck with his new team|date=2025-09-18|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 9th - '''FUT Esports''' part ways with [[zander (Portuguese player)|zander]]. <ref name="-zander">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/2009557124431667268|title=We have parted ways with Zander, analyst for our main CS2 team|date=2026-01-09|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>
*February 13th - '''FUT Esports''' sign [[trochu]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+trochu">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/2022279623925477379|title=Experience, vision, and a winning mentality|date=2026-02-13|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 7th - '''FUT Esports''' bench [[lauNX]] and acquire [[xfl0ud]] from [[HEROIC]] as his replacement. <ref name="lauNX bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/2074418199571968384|title=Effective today, we are moving lauNX to the bench|date=2026-07-07|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+xfl0ud">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FUTesportsgg/status/2074508798320918940|title=Now, he is one of us|date=2026-07-07|author='''FUT Esports'''}}</ref>
}}

