'''Team Spirit''' is a [[:Category:Russia|Russian]] esports organization founded in 2015. The organization has been based in [[:wikipedia:Belgrade|Belgrade]], [[:Category:Serbia|Serbia]] since 2022. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1507024445596225537|date=2022-03-24|title=Team Spirit opens an office in Belgrade|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>

