|content1=
* June 9th - '''Team Spirit''' sign [[Team Phenomenon]] - [[COLDY]], [[S0tF1k]], [[DavCost]], [[kibaken]] and [[Dima]] join, with [[Certus]] serving as the coach. <ref name="Team Spirit">{{cite web|url=http://teamspirit.ru/news/team-spirit-priobreli-komandu-v-discipline-cs-go/|date=2016-06-09|title=TEAM SPIRIT ПРИОБРЕЛИ КОМАНДУ В ДИСЦИПЛИНЕ CS:GO|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Team Spirit acquire CS:GO roster|author=k1ll|publisher=Team Spirit}}</ref>

|content2=
* March 30th - [[kibaken]] leaves '''Team Spirit'''. <ref name="kibaken leaves">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-32151480_125892|date=2017-03-30|title=Сегодня наш состав по CS:GO покидает Антон kibaken Колесников, один из лучших клатчеров в СНГ|language= {{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title= Anton kibaken Kolesnikov left our CS:GO squad|publisher=Team Spirit}}</ref>
* May 10th - [[starix]] joins '''Team Spirit'''. <ref name="starix joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/20437-starix-joins-spirit|date=2017-05-10|title=starix joins Spirit|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[MIRAA]]}}</ref>
* October 4th - [[starix]] steps down from '''Team Spirit'''. <ref name="starix inactive">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21651/starix-steps-down-from-spirit|date=2017-10-04|title=starix steps down from Spirit|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[Professeur]]}}</ref>
* October 23rd - [[arch]] is signed by '''Team Spirit''' after a stand-in period. <ref name="arch joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21837/spirit-sign-arch|date=2017-10-23|title=Spirit sign arch|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[Professeur]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 8th - [[somedieyoung]] replaces [[arch]]. <ref name="SDY replace arch">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-32151480_152910|date=2018-01-08|title=Увы,сегодня мы прощаемся с arch , но ему на смену приходит небезызвестный SDY!|language= {{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title= Unfortunately, today we say goodbye to arch, but his replacement will be well known SDY!|publisher=''''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* February 5th - '''Team Spirit''' release [[starix]]. <ref name="starix released">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/22709/starix-released-from-spirit|date=2018-02-05|title=starix released from Spirit|author=[[LucasAM]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* February 26th - '''Team Spirit''' part ways with [[DavCost]] and [[Dima]]. <ref name="-davcost, dima">{{cite web|url=http://teamspirit.ru/team-spirit-parts-ways-with-dima-and-davcost-eng/|title=Team Spirit has parted ways with Dima & DavCost|date=2019-02-26|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* March 3rd - '''Team Spirit''' sign [[chopper]] and [[iDISBALANCE]]. <ref name="+chopper +iDISBALANCE">{{cite web|url=http://teamspirit.ru/idisbalance-and-chopper-join-team-spirit-eng/|title=Meet the new players of Team Spirit’s CS:GO roster|date=2019-03-03|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* September 26th - '''Team Spirit''' part ways with [[COLDYY1]] and [[S0tF1k]]; they also acquire [[mir]] from [[Gambit Esports]] and add [[magixx]] from [[ESPADA]]. <ref name="COLDYY1 S0tF1k leave">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1177207552528048129|title=Спасибо за все, COLDYY1 и S0tF1k|trans_title=Thanks for everything, COLDYY1 and S0tF1k|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2019-09-26|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref><ref name="mir joins">{{cite web|url=https://teamspirit.ru/welcome-mir/|title=Встречайте, mir!|trans_title=Welcome mir!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2019-09-26|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref><ref name="magixx joins">{{cite web|url=https://teamspirit.ru/magixx-joins-team-spirit/|title=Magixx стал пятым игроком состава Team Spirit по CS:GO|trans_title=Magixx becomes Team Spirit's CSGO fifth player.|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2019-09-26|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 21st - '''Team Spirit''' place [[iDISBALANCE]] on the transfer list and acquire [[degster]] and [[Patsi]] on loan from [[ESPADA]]. <ref name="TS 2021">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1352252220016906241|title=We start this year with CS:GO roster changes|date=2021-01-21|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* March 21st - '''Team Spirit''' sign [[S0tF1k]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+S0tF1k (AC)">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1373599176496402433|title=Our CS:GO roster has become stronger today - @dimasotf joins our coaching staff!|date=2021-03-21|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* March 28th - [[Patsi]] is transferred to [[Team Spirit Academy]]. <ref name="-Patsi">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/@team_spirit-predstavlyaem-team-spirit-academy|title=Team Spirit Academy|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|author='''Team Spirit'''|date=2021-03-28}}</ref>
*April 2nd - [[iDISBALANCE]] is acquired by [[Nemiga Gaming]]. <ref name="-iDISBALANCE">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1378021995183476739|title=iDISBALANCE joins @nemigagg|author='''Team Spirit'''|date=2021-04-02}}</ref>
*July 24th - [[S0tF1k]] and [[hally]] from [[Team Spirit Academy]] switch positions on their respective teams. <ref name="S0t and hally switch">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/@team_spirit-perestanovki-v-trenerskom-shtabe-spirit-csgo|title=Перестановки в тренерском штабе Spirit CS:GO|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Rearrangements in the coaching headquarters of Spirit CS:GO|author='''Team Spirit'''|date=2021-07-24}}</ref>
*November 4th - '''Team Spirit''' bench and transfer-list [[chopper]] and [[mir]]. <ref name="chopper mir bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1456244922722492426|title=Roster changes|author='''Team Spirit'''|date=2021-11-04}}</ref>
*November 12th - '''Team Spirit''' bench and transfer-list [[sdy]]. <ref name="sdy bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1459219538596306944|title=As of today, Viktor sdy Orudzhev will be put on transfer list|author='''Team Spirit'''|date=2021-11-12}}</ref>

|content6=
