* March 19th - '''The MongolZ''' replace [[ncl]] and [[Otgoo]] with [[element]] and [[kabal]]. <ref name="MongolZ switch two">{{cite web|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20160323035901/https://www.e-frag.net/news/events/1213/themongolz-change-two|archivedate=2016-03-23|url=https://www.e-frag.net/news/events/1213/themongolz-change-two|date=2016-03-19|title=The MongolZ change two|author=[[iAN]]|publisher=[[E-Frag]]}}</ref>
* July 12th - [[Machinegun]] leaves '''The MongolZ''' to join [[Splyce]]. <ref name="Three players added to Splyce CS:GO roster">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/18258/splyce-complete-new-roster|title=Splyce complete new roster|date=2016-07-12|author=[[stich]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* November 18th - [[Zilkenberg]] leaves '''The MongolZ'''. <ref name="Zilkenberg leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/TheMongolZ/photos/a.801102386600098.1073741830.801059539937716/1244852012225131|title=Манай CS:GO багийн тоглогч Zilkenberg буюу Тэмүүлэн өнөөдөр албан ёсоор багаас гарсан бөгөөд|trans_title=Our CS:GO team player Zilkenberg or Temunun officially left the team today|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|date=2016-07-18|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* December 13th - [[Machinegun]] re-joins the team. <ref name="Machinegun returns">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/TheMongolZ/photos/a.801102386600098.1073741830.801059539937716/1274253079285024|title=Machinegun returns to our CS:GO squad once again|date=2016-12-13|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* June 20th - [[Zilkenberg]] returns to '''The MongolZ''', replacing [[dobu]]. <ref name="Zilkenberg back, dobu out">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/20773/zilkenberg-returns-to-themongolz|date=2017-06-20|title=Zilkenberg returns to The MongolZ|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* August 5th - [[Kabal]] leaves '''The MongolZ'''. <ref name="Kabal leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/TheMongolZ/photos/a.813351432041860.1073741831.801059539937716/1516431858400477|title=Good luck further kabie!|date=2017-08-05|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* December 1st - [[Zilkenberg]] leaves '''The MongolZ'''. <ref name="MongolZ shuffle"/>
* December 2nd - [[cTrl]] and [[cazze]] join '''The MongolZ''' while [[maaRaa]] replaces [[NokS]] as coach. <ref name="MongolZ shuffle">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/22174/zilkenberg-leaves-themongolz-prompting-roster-changes|title=Zilkenberg leaves TheMongolZ, prompting roster changes|date=2017-12-02|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[BenjaCS]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* February 24th - [[Machinegun]] leaves the '''The MongolZ'''. <ref name="machinegun leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/22887/machinegun-and-themongolz-part-ways|date=2018-02-24|title=Machinegun and TheMongolz parts ways|author=[[LucasAM]] |publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* September 19th - '''The MongolZ''' are signed by Chinese organization [[Storm Rider]]. <ref name="storm rider">{{cite web |url=https://www.hltv.org/news/24834/storm-rider-sign-themongolz-roster |title=Storm Rider sign The Mongolz roster|author=[[flam3z]]|date=2018-09-19|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* May 5th - '''The MongolZ''' return with a lineup consisting of: [[Machinegun]], [[maaRaa]], [[neuz]], [[temk4wow]], and [[Annihilation]]. <ref name="The MongolZ return 2019">{{cite web |url=https://www.facebook.com/TheMongolZ/posts/2312176052159383|title=One last ride!!! Introducing our new lineup|author='''The MongolZ'''|date=2019-05-02}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 17th - '''The MongolZ''' return with a lineup consisting of [[ncl]], [[Tsogoo]], [[Machinegun]], [[MagnumZ]], [[starDUST]], and [[Noks]] as coach. <ref name="return 2022">{{cite web |url=https://www.facebook.com/TheMongolZ/posts/325467172919091|title=Зиак, Энэ оны эхний тэмцээнээр The MongolZ эргэн ирэлтээ зарлаж байгаадаа тун таатай байна|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|trans_title=Yes, we're very pleased to announce The MongolZ's return for this year's competition|author='''The MongolZ''' |date=2022-01-17}}</ref>
* May 3rd - '''The MongolZ''' acquire [[yAmi]] from [[D13]]. <ref name="-machinegun +yami">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/05/17/machinegun-retired-yami-to-the-mongolz/news/|title=Machinegun退役 yAmi加入The MongolZ|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|trans_title=Machinegun retires, yAmi joins The MongolZ|date=2022-05-17|author=[[LemonFox]]|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]}}</ref>
* May 9th - [[Machinegun]] announces his retirement from ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]''. <ref name="-machinegun +yami"/>
* May 10th - [[Noks]] steps down the team. <ref name="+senzu"/>
* June 6th - '''The MongolZ''' sign [[Senzu]] and part ways with [[starDUST]]. <ref name="+senzu">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/06/07/senzu-joins-the-mongolz-ar1ko-joins-the-shine/news/|title=Senzu加入The MongolZ ar1ko加盟The Shine|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|trans_title=Senzu joins The MongolZ ar1ko joins The Shine|date=2022-06-07|author=[[LemonFox]]|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]}}</ref>
* July 25th - [[MagnumZ]] is acquired by [[Aravt]]. <ref name="-magnumz">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=439975758144242|date=2022-07-25|title=The MongolZ багт хүчин зүтгэж байсан MagnumZ нь манай багийн 5 дахь гишүүнээр нэгдэж байгааг дуулгахад таатай байна|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|trans_title=We are pleased to announce that MagnumZ, formerly of The MongolZ, is joining our team as our 5th member|author=[[Aravt]]}}</ref>
* August 1st - [[mzinho]] joins '''The MongolZ''' on trial.  <ref name="mzinho trial">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/08/09/the-mongolz-trial-training-mzinho/news/|date=2022-08-09 |trans_title=The MongolZ trial mzinho|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|title=The MongolZ 試訓mzinho|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>
* August 10th - '''The MongolZ''' add [[PRISM]] as stand-in and part ways with [[mzinho]].  <ref name="prism -mzinho">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/08/16/the-transfer-and-transfer-news-august-14-to-august-15-spinx-is-transferred-to-vitality-top-nip-lineup-before-rmr-preselection/news/|date=2022-08-16|trans_title=Team transfer and transfer news (August 14th to August 15th)...|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|title=隊伍調動及轉會消息 (8月14日至8月15日)...|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>
* October 17th - '''The MongolZ''''s lineup leaves to reform [[Mazaalai]]. <ref name="mazaalai 2022">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/10/19/the-mongolz-lineup-turned-to-mazalai/news/|date=2022-10-19 |title=The MongolZ陣容轉為Mazaalai|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese |trans_title=The MongolZ lineup shifts to Mazaalai|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>

|content6=
* April 3rd - '''The MongolZ''' reform as an organization-less team with a roster consisting of: [[bLitz]], [[Techno4K]], [[Bart4k]], [[ANNIHILATION]], and [[hasteka]] after the lineup leaves [[IHC Esports]]. Additionally, [[maaRaa]] joins as coach. <ref name="the mongolz 2023">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/35905/former-ihc-players-revive-themongolz-ahead-of-rmr|title=Former IHC players revive TheMongolZ ahead of RMR|date=2023-04-03|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[LucasAM]]}}</ref>
* May 31st - '''The MongolZ''' replace [[Bart4k]] and [[ANNIHILATION]] with [[mzinho]] and [[910]]. <ref name="update 2023">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/36390/themongolz-replace-bart4k-and-annihilation|date=2023-05-31|title=TheMongolz replace Bart4k and ANNIHILATION|author=[[King Dempz]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* September 4th - '''The MongolZ''' part ways with [[hasteka]]. <ref name="-hasteka">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/MongolzCs/status/1698681641907179742|date=2023-09-04|title=We announces the Hasteka officially leaving the team|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* September 7th - '''The MongolZ''' acquire [[Senzu]] from [[Team NKT]]. <ref name="+Senzu23">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/TheMongolZ/videos/644609094511620/|date=2023-09-07|title=WELCOME TO THE MONGOLZ|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>

|content7=
* October 22nd - '''The MongolZ''' bench [[Senzu]]. <ref name="senzu bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/1981029679831425467|date=2025-10-22|title=Today, we made the difficult decision to move Senzu to the bench|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* December 31st - '''The MongolZ''' acquire [[cobrazera]] from [[The Huns Esports]]. <ref name="+cobra">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2006399375556378918|date=2025-12-31|title=The Roster is Locked|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>

|content8=
* February 13th - '''The MongolZ''' loan [[Senzu]] to [[Passion UA]]. <ref name="senzu loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2022370565068304406|date=2026-02-13|title=On loan to Passion UA|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* April 27th - [[Senzu]]'s loan to [[Passion UA]] ends, '''The MongolZ''' loan him to [[BC.Game Esports]]. <ref name="senzu loan2">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2048792109818208574|date=2026-04-27|title=On loan|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* June 23rd - [[Senzu]] is acquired by [[BC.Game Esports]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="-senzu">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2069452780235018325|title=Senzu|date=2026-06-23|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* July 9th - [[mzinho]] is acquired by [[BC.Game Esports]]. <ref name="-mzinho">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2075267046125011348|title=Thank you, mzinho|date=2026-07-09|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* July 12th - '''The MongolZ''' bench [[cobrazera]], acquire [[Tikuak]] from [[Chinggis Warriors]], and promote [[DarkMeister]] from the [[The MongolZ Academy|academy team]]. <ref name="cobrazera bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2076199929937310132|title=cobrazera has been moved to the bench and steps away from our active lineup|date=2026-07-12|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref><ref name="+Tikuak +DarkMeister">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2076271684416643414|title=Introducing the newest additions to The MongolZ CS2 roster from The MongolZ Academy|date=2026-07-12|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
* September 15th - '''The MongolZ''' bench [[Tikuak]] and [[DarkMeister]]. <ref name="tikuak darkmeister bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2099830616854552802|title=DarkMeister and tikuak have been moved to the bench and step away from our active lineup|date=2026-09-15|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
}}

